# Project artifacts. Everything under artifacts/ is regenerable working output
# and stays out of the repo, except the stow reference set below: the extracted
# operator and the trained hole policy are inputs to stages 2 and 4, so a fresh
# clone can run those without first reproducing stages 1 and 3.
data/
artifacts/*
!artifacts/stow/
artifacts/stow/*
!artifacts/stow/*.json
!artifacts/stow/stage3/
artifacts/stow/stage3/*
!artifacts/stow/stage3/1790788534/
artifacts/stow/stage3/1790788534/*
!artifacts/stow/stage3/1790788534/sac_hole_best.zip
!artifacts/stow/stage3/1790788534/summary.json
!artifacts/stow/stage3/1790788534/precondition.json
# Drawer: the small JSON results (gate, operator, plan, hole spec) are tracked,
# and so is every Stage 3 run's configuration, summary and evaluation, with the
# checkpoint checksums in stage3/checkpoints.json. Checkpoints and videos are
# kept outside normal Git (see stage3/checkpoints.json for how to verify a copy).
!artifacts/drawer/
artifacts/drawer/*
!artifacts/drawer/*.json
!artifacts/drawer/stage3/
artifacts/drawer/stage3/*
!artifacts/drawer/stage3/*.json
!artifacts/drawer/stage3/*/
artifacts/drawer/stage3/*/*
!artifacts/drawer/stage3/*/*.json
# Direct baseline (targeted versus direct learning): tracked the same way, plus
# its learning-curve figure; checkpoints and videos stay outside normal Git.
!artifacts/drawer/direct/
artifacts/drawer/direct/*
!artifacts/drawer/direct/*.json
!artifacts/drawer/direct/*.png
!artifacts/drawer/direct/*/
artifacts/drawer/direct/*/*
!artifacts/drawer/direct/*/*.json
# The paper's figure and table, with the exact data behind them.
!artifacts/drawer/paper/
# The relaxed and exact planners compared: named scenarios and random problems.
!artifacts/planner_comparison/
# mean + relaxed against min_max + exact on the real pipelines: results and report.
!artifacts/default_mode_validation/
# The final verification of fe374f0: the report, the scripts that ran it, the small fresh
# outputs, and manifest.json (planner version, each run's command and planner calls, the large
# outputs' summaries, every file's checksum). Large outputs, call records and logs stay local.
!artifacts/final_verification_fe374f0/
artifacts/final_verification_fe374f0/*
!artifacts/final_verification_fe374f0/*.md
!artifacts/final_verification_fe374f0/*.py
!artifacts/final_verification_fe374f0/*.json
!artifacts/final_verification_fe374f0/run.sh
!artifacts/final_verification_fe374f0/direct/
artifacts/final_verification_fe374f0/stow_stage4.json
artifacts/final_verification_fe374f0/drawer_stage4.json
artifacts/final_verification_fe374f0/drawer_final_targeted_vs_direct.json
artifacts/final_verification_fe374f0/planning_checks.json
# The signed-literal phase (2026-11-11): the report, the plan, the scripts that ran it, the run
# records, the stages' JSON outputs, the diagnostics, and manifest.json (every step's command and
# commit, every file's checksum, and the summaries of the five large outputs left out below).
# Checkpoints, console logs and the baseline's copies of committed files stay local.
!artifacts/signed_literals_20261111/
artifacts/signed_literals_20261111/**/*.zip
artifacts/signed_literals_20261111/**/*.log
artifacts/signed_literals_20261111/logs/
artifacts/signed_literals_20261111/00_baseline/refs/
artifacts/signed_literals_20261111/E0_stage0/retreat_gate.json
artifacts/signed_literals_20261111/R_retreat_validation/retreat_gate.json
artifacts/signed_literals_20261111/E4_stage4/drawer_stage4.json
artifacts/signed_literals_20261111/E4_stage4/final_targeted_vs_direct.json
artifacts/signed_literals_20261111/D_diagnostics/direct_full_horizon.json
# Round 1 (2026-11-11): the correctness audit's report, its symbolic regression (script and
# output) and the test run. The regression's first, faulty run stays local.
!artifacts/round1_correctness_20261111/
artifacts/round1_correctness_20261111/*.attempt*
checkpoints/
logs/
wandb/
runs/
outputs/

